# MotionLab Environment Configuration Example
# MotionLab is an offline-first, client-side motion graphics application.
# It does NOT require external API keys, database credentials, or secret tokens.
#
# On native Android Termux/userspace environments, the SWC WASM binding path is set locally:
# NEXT_TEST_WASM_DIR="./node_modules/@next/swc-wasm-nodejs"
#
# When deployed on Vercel or standard Linux/macOS/Windows x64 servers, Next.js automatically
# uses native binary bindings without needing any environment variable.
